# {{{@site.title}}}

> {{{@site.description}}}

This site is a Salesforce learning platform built on Ghost. Content lives in
three collections: structured courses at /courses/ (each course has ordered
lessons at /courses/{course}/{lesson}/), modular training at /training/
(module pages at /training/{module}/{page}/), and articles at /blog/.

## Navigation
{{#foreach @site.navigation}}
- [{{{label}}}]({{#match this.url "~^" "http"}}{{this.url}}{{else}}{{@site.url}}{{this.url}}{{/match}})
{{/foreach}}

## Courses

Each course is free and lesson-based. A lesson's URL nests under its course.
{{#get "posts" filter="tag:[hash-course-col,hash-courses-col]" order="published_at asc" limit="50" as |courses|}}
{{#foreach courses}}

### [{{{title}}}]({{url absolute="true"}})
{{#if custom_excerpt}}
{{{custom_excerpt}}}
{{/if}}
{{#> "with-this" courseSlug=slug}}
{{#get "posts" filter="tag:[hash-lesson-col,hash-lessons-col]+tag:{{courseSlug}}" order="published_at asc" limit="100" as |lessons|}}
{{#foreach lessons}}
- [{{{title}}}]({{url absolute="true"}})
{{/foreach}}
{{/get}}
{{/with-this}}
{{/foreach}}
{{/get}}

## Training modules

A module is a topic worked through in order; its pages share a primary tag.
{{#get "tags" filter="visibility:public" order="slug asc" limit="30" as |moduleTags|}}
{{#foreach moduleTags}}
{{#> "with-this" moduleTag=.}}
{{#get "posts" filter="tag:{{moduleTag.slug}}+tag:[hash-training-col,hash-docs-col]" order="published_at asc" limit="100" as |modulePosts|}}
{{#if modulePosts}}

### {{{../moduleTag.name}}}{{#if ../moduleTag.description}} — {{{../moduleTag.description}}}{{/if}}
{{#foreach modulePosts}}
- [{{{title}}}]({{url absolute="true"}})
{{/foreach}}
{{/if}}
{{/get}}
{{/with-this}}
{{/foreach}}
{{/get}}

## Recent writing
{{#get "posts" filter="tag:hash-blog-col" limit="15" as |articles|}}
{{#foreach articles}}
- [{{{title}}}]({{url absolute="true"}}) — {{date format="YYYY-MM-DD"}}{{#if custom_excerpt}}: {{{custom_excerpt}}}{{/if}}
{{/foreach}}
{{/get}}

